rmanent.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2383235948825296312' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2383235948825296312' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1062624314"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 22, 2014 at 12:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6954930063181253194</id><published>2014-03-19T19:15:57.926-06:00</published><updated>2014-03-19T19:15:57.926-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr Griggs,&#xa;You might find this interesting.&#xa;&#xa;http:...</title><content type='html'>Mr Griggs,&lt;br /&gt;You might find this interesting.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.fatalencounters.org/posts/</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2383235948825296312/comments/default/6954930063181253194'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2383235948825296312/comments/default/6954930063181253194'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/03/one-unjustified-arrest-one-permanent.html?showComment=1395278157926#c6954930063181253194' title=''/><author><name>Bill Jones</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/03/one-unjustified-arrest-one-permanent.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2383235948825296312' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2383235948825296312' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2140661373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 19, 2014 at 7:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2853751797060794034